                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE REVENUE CYCLE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Three phases. One continuous flow of money.</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"180\" width=\"320\" height=\"780\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">FRONT-END</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Pre-service &amp; service</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Scheduling</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"365\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Registration</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Insurance</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">  verification</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"465\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Prior</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"495\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">  authorization</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"530\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Eligibility</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"565\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Financial</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"595\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">  counseling</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"630\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- POS collections</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"700\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OWNER:</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"730\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Patient Access</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">FAILURE MODE:</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"830\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Wrong insurance</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"860\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- no auth =</text><text x=\"80\" y=\"890\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">guaranteed denial</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"180\" width=\"320\" height=\"780\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">MIDDLE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Care &amp; documentation</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Provider</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">  documentation</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Charge capture</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- HIM coding</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"465\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">  (ICD-10, CPT)</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"500\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- CDI queries</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"535\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Utilization mgmt</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"570\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Case management</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"605\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Encoder grouping</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"700\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OWNER:</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"730\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">HIM, CDI,</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"760\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Providers</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">FAILURE MODE:</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"830\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Missing MCCs,</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"860\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">charge leakage,</text><text x=\"420\" y=\"890\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">poor specificity</text><rect x=\"730\" y=\"180\" width=\"320\" height=\"780\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"890\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">BACK-END</text><text x=\"890\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Claims &amp; collections</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Claim assembly</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"365\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Claim scrubbing</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"400\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- 837I / 837P</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">  submission</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"465\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- 835 remittance</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"500\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Denial mgmt</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"535\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Appeals</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"570\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- A/R follow-up</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"605\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">- Patient billing</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"700\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OWNER:</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"730\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Patient Financial</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"760\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Services (PFS)</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">FAILURE MODE:</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"830\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Unworked denials,</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"860\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">bad timely filing,</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"890\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">write-offs</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The three-phase revenue cycle with owners and failure modes"
