                  "explanation": "Heart transplants are PRE-MDC DRGs — they're assigned BEFORE MDC logic runs because the resource intensity is extreme. DRG 001 is heart transplant with MCC and DRG 002 is heart transplant or implant of heart assist system without MCC. Pre-MDC also includes ECMO, prolonged trach with MV, liver/lung/pancreas transplants, and bone marrow transplants.",
                  "visual": {
                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"36\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pre-MDC: The Express Lane</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" font-size=\"24\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Bypasses MDC logic; assigned first</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.15)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Pre-MDC DRG Map</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"295\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">001 Heart transplant or heart assist w/ MCC</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"330\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">002 Heart transplant or heart assist w/o MCC</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"365\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">003 ECMO or trach w/ MV &gt;96 hrs (w/ major OR)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"400\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">004 Trach w/ MV &gt;96 hrs (no major OR)</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"435\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">005-006 Liver transplant w/ or w/o MCC</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"470\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">007 Lung transplant | 008 Sim pancreas/kidney tx</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"520\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Why Pre-MDC Exists</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"625\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">Resource use is so high that grouping by MDC</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"665\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">would distort payment within the body system MDC.</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"710\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\">Highest RWs in entire MS-DRG system</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"760\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" font-size=\"26\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\">Example Relative Weights</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"865\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">DRG 001 (Heart tx w/ MCC): ~26.2823</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"905\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#fff\">DRG 003 (ECMO/trach w/ major OR): ~17.7611</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"950\" font-size=\"22\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\">Single discharge can exceed $150K payment</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "Pre-MDC DRGs (heart transplant, ECMO, prolonged trach, organ tx, BMT) bypass MDC logic and command the highest RWs."
                  }
