                    "type": "diagram",
                    "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"36\" font-weight=\"bold\">HIM Career Evolution</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Risk adjustment is the emerging specialty</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Why Risk-Adjustment Coding Matters</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"275\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">MA = 30M+ beneficiaries</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"306\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Avg member generates $12K/yr CMS revenue</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"347\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">0.10 RAF improvement on 100K members</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"378\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">= $120M annually</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"430\" width=\"500\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Career Pathways</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">CRC (AAPC)</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"566\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">CCS-P with RA focus</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"597\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">RA Analyst</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">RA Director</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"659\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Outpatient CDI</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Growing demand</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"430\" width=\"480\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"810\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">Key Skills</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Deep ICD-10-CM</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"566\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">EHR navigation</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"597\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Provider engagement</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"628\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Analytics, gap reports</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"659\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Compliance, MEAT</text><text x=\"810\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Annual recapture workflow</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"785\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"bold\">The Shift</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"830\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">From: inpatient DRG capture only</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"861\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">To: outpatient HCC + DRG + quality measures</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"902\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">From: 1-time code, 1-time payment</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"933\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">To: annual chronic condition recapture</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">HIM is at the center of the value-based care economy</text></svg>",
                    "caption": "The expanding HIM career landscape with risk adjustment at the center"
